/service-go-echo

# What a Go build leaves behind. Kept here rather than at the repository root: this repository also
# holds .NET, Node, Python and Rust, and *.dll, *.so, *.dylib, *.out and *.test at the root would
# quietly cover a file any of them might one day mean to track. The Rust services scope theirs the
# same way. Lock files stay tracked — go.sum is committed for the same reason as package-lock.json.
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
vendor/
go.work
go.work.sum
